  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preserves one W3C trace across ASP.NET Core, CoreWCF and business dependencies, including unsampled remote parents; captures sanitized CoreWCF service exceptions before SOAP fault creation; adds a fail-safe global kill switch; bounds WCF baggage propagation and large-payload redaction allocations; validates export through a real CoreWCF provider gate; updates stable OpenTelemetry packages to 1.17.0; and pins XML cryptography to the patched 10.0.10 release without raising existing Microsoft.Extensions minimums.",
